<title>NORWAY: TABLE-Statoil H1 net profit rises 12.5 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Statoil H1 net profit rises 12.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30.</p>
<p>				 (billion crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>  Operating revenues	 59.1	vs	  49.5</p>
<p>  Operating profit	   10.1	vs	   8.2</p>
<p>  Net profit		    2.7	vs	   2.4</p>
<p>NOTE -- Full name of state-owned Norwegian oil and gas company is Den norske stats oljeselskap AS (Statoil).</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
